---
/**
 * Architecture Section
 *
 * About page section highlighting Chassis' architecture, with stats and links to GitHub and contribution guidelines.
 */
---

<section class="about-section overflow-hidden py-3xl md:py-6xl">
  <div class="container 2xl">
    <div class="row g-md lg:g-3xl">
      <div class="font-lg col-12 lg:col-6">
        <h2>Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          Chassis is five packages built on a shared foundation: design tokens, a Figma component
          library, a CSS framework, an asset distributor, and an icon pipeline.
        </p>
        <p>
          Each package is independently useful and can be adopted on its own. Together, they connect
          design decisions in Figma to production code.
        </p>
        <p>
          All five are MIT-licensed. Clone them, adapt them, and use them as the foundation of your
          own design system — your tokens, your brands, your platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 lg:col-6 lg:pt-6xl">
        <div class="row g-md">
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xl">
              <p class="font-4xl font-mass fg-primary m-0">5</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">packages</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xl">
              <p class="font-4xl font-mass fg-primary m-0">MIT</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">licensed</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xl">
              <p class="font-4xl font-mass fg-primary m-0">W3C</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">compatible</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 text-center">
            <div class="card py-xl">
              <p class="font-4xl font-mass fg-primary m-0">3+</p>
              <p class="fg-subtle m-0">platforms</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
